error[E8019]  a/a.canon:31:3
  emit ts in data mode cannot generate a dependent value decided through an optional, a record parameter, a ref into a `@reload` value or a ref into an enclosing record's table field; decide it by an enum field of the same record, or by a ref into a let that is not `@reload`

